	(text "Notes:\n1) U8 is retriggerable, ~110 ms (R14 × C7, Q1 discharges C7). Its output only \n   matters while TAPE_LOW is asserted, giving a grace window. \n2) R8 and R10 pull up totem-pole lines from the logic board; the default \n   is TAPE_LOW and TAPE_ERROR. \n3) U6D is a NAND wired as an inverter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
